WEBVTT

00:17.570 --> 00:22.479
Master Naofumi saved my life.

00:22.480 --> 00:26.119
Atla would have died
in the slave dungeon of Zeltoble

00:26.120 --> 00:28.510
if she hadn't been saved
by the Shield Hero.

00:30.480 --> 00:32.760
So you're here.

00:35.300 --> 00:37.529
How are those children?

00:37.530 --> 00:39.330
That Hakuko's siblings...

00:40.210 --> 00:44.320
They went to Siltvelt with the Shield Hero.

00:45.980 --> 00:48.249
You really let them go?

00:48.250 --> 00:49.700
Those two of Hakuko's...

00:50.130 --> 00:51.880
...to Siltvelt?

01:02.960 --> 01:04.920
Magic Prism!

01:07.210 --> 01:09.760
Now's our chance! Don't falter!

01:10.220 --> 01:12.040
Drifa Shine Ray!

01:34.610 --> 01:37.050
In the war with our country...

01:38.900 --> 01:42.770
Tyran, the Hakuko who led Siltvelt,
was killed...

01:46.250 --> 01:50.369
The Hakuko race, who were forced
to take full responsibility for the war,

01:50.370 --> 01:53.530
are said to have lost their influence
in the country since.

01:55.710 --> 01:59.799
Those two are descendants of Tyran.

01:59.800 --> 02:01.980
Who knows what will happen
to them there...

02:02.360 --> 02:05.709
They have their own path to follow.

02:05.710 --> 02:06.880
But...

02:10.590 --> 02:13.360
Mr. Iwatani is with them.

02:14.870 --> 02:17.650
For now, let us pray for their safety.

02:30.050 --> 02:32.550
I can bear no more of this!

02:33.770 --> 02:34.630
Huh?

02:42.390 --> 02:46.100
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

04:05.520 --> 04:09.440
EPISODE 3: THE TRUE PEOPLE

04:09.870 --> 04:12.650
What is that Hakuko saying?

04:16.370 --> 04:18.380
A Hakuko with tainted blood.

04:18.950 --> 04:20.420
W-What?

04:20.970 --> 04:24.459
That Hakuko has human blood mixed in...?

04:24.460 --> 04:26.159
Could she be Tyran's...

04:26.160 --> 04:29.509
You Hakuko!
You have no right to speak here!

04:29.510 --> 04:30.830
Be gone!

04:32.530 --> 04:35.910
Tainted blood? No right to speak?

04:36.390 --> 04:37.700
How pathetic...

04:38.370 --> 04:41.050
You poison us and still have
the nerve to say that?!

04:41.390 --> 04:43.299
I don't get what you're saying.

04:43.300 --> 04:46.509
The people of Siltvelt,
especially you...

04:46.510 --> 04:47.679
Watch your mouth!

04:47.680 --> 04:49.020
No, I won't!

04:49.610 --> 04:53.230
Have you forgotten
the most important thing?!

04:53.710 --> 04:57.690
If I back down here,
I won't be able to forgive myself!

04:58.050 --> 04:59.280
Atla...

05:00.210 --> 05:03.339
I am the shield of Master Naofumi,
and I declare...

05:03.340 --> 05:05.640
...that you are wrong!

05:09.870 --> 05:12.480
You dare say we're wrong?!

05:13.560 --> 05:17.960
Yes. Because you are
disregarding the Shield Hero.

05:18.290 --> 05:19.519
What nonsense is that?!

05:19.520 --> 05:22.129
How could we possibly
disregard the Hero?!

05:22.130 --> 05:27.220
We are welcoming the Shield Hero with
the utmost sincerity, as you can see.

05:27.620 --> 05:32.100
Then why won't you listen to
Master Naofumi's requests as the Shield Hero?

05:33.480 --> 05:38.349
Moreover, your many disrespectful actions
since Master Naofumi's arrival...

05:38.350 --> 05:42.189
I've been both disappointed
by your so-called faith

05:42.190 --> 05:45.920
and ashamed at myself
for not realizing it sooner.

05:47.010 --> 05:49.729
Now, let me ask you:

05:49.730 --> 05:52.920
Do you even know how Siltvelt was founded?

05:55.840 --> 05:57.339
T-That's because...

05:57.340 --> 06:01.510
...the Shield Hero created this country for us
Demi-Humans and Therianthropes.

06:01.880 --> 06:02.889
Exactly.

06:02.890 --> 06:07.230
The founding of this country is
the same as Lurolona Village,

06:08.160 --> 06:11.340
the village that Master Naofumi
restored and accepted me into.

06:27.490 --> 06:29.609
But we're still slaves, though.

06:29.610 --> 06:30.720
And yet,

06:31.570 --> 06:35.080
so many Demi-Humans and Therianthropes
were welcomed into Lurolona Village.

06:35.410 --> 06:39.800
He gave them not only a place to live
but also hope for the future.

06:40.330 --> 06:42.340
I want to repay all of that...

06:42.850 --> 06:46.510
...with devoting myself to
Master Naofumi and loving him.

06:47.960 --> 06:49.700
That is what made me...

06:50.340 --> 06:52.430
...a proud villager of that village...

06:52.870 --> 06:57.300
...and what made all of you
the people of Siltvelt.

06:58.910 --> 07:00.749
That's right.

07:00.750 --> 07:04.280
We are the proud people of Siltvelt.

07:04.670 --> 07:07.280
Everything is for the Shield Hero.

07:07.850 --> 07:12.099
We owe our lives to the Shield Hero,
to Master Naofumi.

07:12.100 --> 07:13.389
Am I wrong?

07:13.390 --> 07:14.120
That's right!

07:14.470 --> 07:19.380
We may live in different countries,
but we all share the same devotion.

07:19.720 --> 07:23.379
B-But our frontier village
is so small in comparison...

07:23.380 --> 07:27.220
So are you saying your country
was a great country from the start?

07:28.460 --> 07:33.189
Is the village Master Naofumi is restoring
insignificant because it's small?

07:33.190 --> 07:34.680
But...

07:35.070 --> 07:39.270
Then, why do we have strength, claws,
and fangs in the first place?

07:40.050 --> 07:42.900
I want you to think about it!

07:43.290 --> 07:45.400
To rule the world?

07:45.790 --> 07:48.179
Or to protect the others?

07:48.180 --> 07:49.620
T-That's...

07:49.930 --> 07:51.609
I told you already!

07:51.610 --> 07:55.540
Everything is for Master Naofumi,
the Shield Hero!

07:56.830 --> 07:59.630
Even if I'm scorned
as having tainted blood...

08:00.020 --> 08:01.959
The blood that flows through this body,

08:01.960 --> 08:06.630
my instincts, and my soul all cry out...

08:07.090 --> 08:10.150
...to prove my loyalty
to Master Naofumi.

08:11.320 --> 08:14.130
The Waves of Calamity is coming.

08:14.790 --> 08:17.810
And now is the time to renew
our vow of loyalty to him,

08:18.180 --> 08:20.119
and to serve him as his vassals!

08:20.120 --> 08:22.409
She's right! Our loyalty to the Hero!

08:22.410 --> 08:26.280
There's no doubt now!
He is the Hero we've been longing for!

08:26.590 --> 08:29.489
That damn Hakuko...

08:29.490 --> 08:31.549
Geez, Atla...

08:31.550 --> 08:33.229
How should I put this...

08:33.230 --> 08:37.250
I don't feel like she's said anything wrong,
so I really have nothing to say.

08:37.590 --> 08:40.249
Yeah. She's pretty impressive.

08:40.250 --> 08:43.689
Our mission is to serve the Shield Hero

08:43.690 --> 08:47.110
and save the world
when the great calamity arrives.

08:47.800 --> 08:50.550
This girl reminded us of that.

08:51.260 --> 08:55.350
Nevertheless, poisoning the Hero
is absolutely unforgivable!

08:55.710 --> 08:57.659
That's right, it's unforgivable!

08:57.660 --> 08:59.279
It's a crime worthy of death!

08:59.280 --> 09:01.819
Why did you commit
such a barbaric act?!

09:01.820 --> 09:03.659
Are you accusing us?!

09:03.660 --> 09:06.189
Where is your proof?!

09:06.190 --> 09:07.740
Sadeena, Filo!

09:08.520 --> 09:09.949
Coming.

09:09.950 --> 09:12.240
We've brought the proof here.

09:12.760 --> 09:15.000
Ah, Master!

09:18.750 --> 09:20.480
Now, have a seat.

09:22.310 --> 09:24.129
I-It's my honor

09:24.130 --> 09:28.339
as the royal chef that is responsible for
preparing breakfast for the Shield Hero.

09:28.340 --> 09:31.340
My name is Denny.

09:40.910 --> 09:44.680
Master, is breakfast ready yet?

09:45.080 --> 09:47.439
Can I eat it even if it's poisoned?

09:47.440 --> 09:50.070
Not until this poison issue is resolved.

09:50.430 --> 09:51.530
Aight...

09:52.360 --> 09:57.570
For the past three days, I had Ethan
keep an eye on the castle's activities.

10:00.430 --> 10:02.500
A Hakuko staying with the Hero?

10:03.700 --> 10:07.880
Your excessive hospitality was more than
enough reason for us to be suspicious.

10:08.220 --> 10:12.260
That's when I witnessed this man
adding poison to the breakfast.

10:13.860 --> 10:17.010
Please, forgive me.
It wasn't me...

10:18.040 --> 10:19.329
I just...

10:19.330 --> 10:22.250
Don't worry.
Your family is safe.

10:22.920 --> 10:26.350
They're protected in a secure place.

10:27.420 --> 10:28.900
Hero...

10:29.250 --> 10:30.860
Who told you to do this?

10:35.210 --> 10:36.820
It's Mr. Jaralis.

10:40.540 --> 10:43.330
I was threatened and forced to obey him!

10:43.810 --> 10:45.979
He's not lying.

10:45.980 --> 10:47.040
So it seems.

10:49.700 --> 10:52.909
Strange... I don't recognize your face.

10:52.910 --> 10:55.569
Did I really give you that order?

10:55.570 --> 10:58.300
Or did someone just mention my name to you?

10:58.830 --> 11:00.059
That's...

11:00.060 --> 11:05.089
Shield Hero, this is clearly
a plot to defame me.

11:05.090 --> 11:07.239
Unless, of course, you have other evidence?

11:07.240 --> 11:09.769
Y-Yes! Show us your proof!

11:09.770 --> 11:10.919
What proof?!

11:10.920 --> 11:13.049
Just admit your guilt honorably!

11:13.050 --> 11:14.960
So he doesn't even flinch, huh...

11:17.680 --> 11:18.760
Let's go.

11:21.880 --> 11:24.199
I've had enough with this!
Let's go, Filo.

11:24.200 --> 11:25.429
Right~

11:25.430 --> 11:29.339
Either way, I can't stay in a country
that would try to poison me.

11:29.340 --> 11:31.119
Do whatever you want.

11:31.120 --> 11:32.499
Shield Hero!

11:32.500 --> 11:33.800
Please wait!

11:34.410 --> 11:37.220
I have something to say as well.

11:37.700 --> 11:39.809
I object to the claim...

11:39.810 --> 11:44.309
...that the Shield Hero standing before us
is the Hero that we've been longing for!

11:44.310 --> 11:46.939
Jaralis! That's outrageous!

11:46.940 --> 11:50.149
It's precisely because I care deeply
about Siltvelt's future

11:50.150 --> 11:55.659
and wish for its prosperity that I'm willing
to risk my life to offer a word of caution

11:55.660 --> 11:59.529
to the Shield Hero so that
we do not make the wrong decision.

11:59.530 --> 12:01.190
Master Naofumi...

12:01.680 --> 12:02.490
No...

12:02.870 --> 12:04.730
Our god makes no mistakes!

12:07.470 --> 12:12.359
Or are you foolish enough to claim
that Master Naofumi is a false Hero?!

12:12.360 --> 12:14.619
I have no intention of going that far.

12:14.620 --> 12:18.169
I'm simply questioning whether
the Calamity foretold in the legends

12:18.170 --> 12:20.390
is truly upon us at this very moment.

12:22.020 --> 12:24.819
If these truly are the Waves
prophesied to destroy the world,

12:24.820 --> 12:30.620
why was the Shield Hero summoned
to Melromarc instead of our country?

12:32.020 --> 12:37.079
That alone proves he is not
the Hero we are longing for!

12:37.080 --> 12:41.079
I am doubting...!
Is this man truly the Hero...

12:41.080 --> 12:43.330
...that we've been waiting for this time!

12:44.660 --> 12:48.919
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

12:48.920 --> 12:53.080
The Shield Hero is not the Hero
we've been longing for...?

12:53.990 --> 12:57.880
Then why was the Shield Hero
summoned to Melromarc?

12:58.290 --> 13:02.210
So this is the reason Jaralis was so calm...

13:03.570 --> 13:05.449
The answer is obvious.

13:05.450 --> 13:07.659
It is exactly because this is
the prophesied time

13:07.660 --> 13:11.869
that the Shield Hero was summoned
together with the other Three Heroes.

13:11.870 --> 13:15.820
The true power of the heroes lies in sharing
their individual powers with each other.

13:16.910 --> 13:20.399
In other words, Master Naofumi
was summoned to Melromarc

13:20.400 --> 13:23.100
so he could cooperate with
the other Three Heroes.

13:25.030 --> 13:27.999
That is your proof that
the world is in danger!

13:28.000 --> 13:29.329
Keep your sophistry to yourself!

13:29.330 --> 13:30.929
Who is the true sophist here?!

13:30.930 --> 13:34.839
I speak as one who has pledged
loyalty to Master Naofumi!

13:34.840 --> 13:39.970
And yet, even among the so-called loyal,
there are those who still doubt him.

13:45.050 --> 13:47.879
Didn't you find it strange?

13:47.880 --> 13:50.389
If they were truly loyal to the Hero,

13:50.390 --> 13:53.400
then why didn't Werner
arrange a ship for him?

13:54.130 --> 13:56.919
Unless he stays in this country,

13:56.920 --> 14:01.150
those who doubt he is truly the Hero
we've been waiting for won't be convinced.

14:01.610 --> 14:03.450
Am I wrong?

14:03.900 --> 14:05.320
That's...

14:05.640 --> 14:07.170
You people...

14:07.770 --> 14:10.319
You're all only thinking of yourselves

14:10.320 --> 14:13.540
and treating Master Naofumi with disregard!

14:14.900 --> 14:17.500
What an unpleasant thing to hear here.

14:19.650 --> 14:22.219
She may be young, but her will is strong.

14:22.220 --> 14:25.320
Frail in body, yet fierce in spirit.

14:26.390 --> 14:32.169
If one were asked who truly
embodies the people of Siltvelt,

14:32.170 --> 14:35.730
I believe most would say it's her.

14:36.340 --> 14:37.690
Why are you here?

14:39.430 --> 14:41.319
So you've come.

14:41.320 --> 14:42.360
Who is he?

14:42.800 --> 14:44.659
He is an elder of the Genmu race.

14:44.660 --> 14:46.870
He has already retired

14:47.510 --> 14:51.500
but still holds great influence
in many fields.

14:54.690 --> 15:00.000
Shield Hero, it is a great honor to meet you.

15:00.420 --> 15:04.969
You may simply call me 'Elder.'

15:04.970 --> 15:07.320
Elder, that form...

15:07.790 --> 15:09.929
You stand before the Shield Hero.

15:09.930 --> 15:12.119
Ah, my apologies.

15:12.120 --> 15:16.729
I remain in this form at all times
to keep myself protected,

15:16.730 --> 15:18.680
so I had completely forgotten.

15:22.320 --> 15:25.650
I've heard the whole conversation.

15:26.530 --> 15:30.219
Isn't everything she said absolutely correct?

15:30.220 --> 15:32.529
Don't you think it is the height of folly

15:32.530 --> 15:38.899
to think only of yourself
and despise the Shield Hero?

15:38.900 --> 15:40.540
The Elder is right!

15:40.860 --> 15:43.869
Are you suggesting that we listen
to this tainted blood race?!

15:43.870 --> 15:47.179
That's not something true
people of Siltvelt would do!

15:47.180 --> 15:48.660
Is that so?

15:49.870 --> 15:54.240
If you insist on being an obstacle to
Master Naofumi's path at every turn...

15:55.420 --> 15:57.849
...then I shall remove you
using physical force!

15:57.850 --> 15:58.940
Atla!

15:59.610 --> 16:01.249
Such insolence!

16:01.250 --> 16:04.689
I'll erase this tainted-blooded
Hakuko with my own hands!

16:04.690 --> 16:06.030
I accept your challenge!

16:07.010 --> 16:08.950
Silence, both of you!

16:12.580 --> 16:16.309
This debate is going nowhere.

16:16.310 --> 16:19.469
In that case, perhaps it's time.

16:19.470 --> 16:24.250
In accordance with Siltvelt tradition,
we should settle this with a duel.

16:25.760 --> 16:26.969
A duel?

16:26.970 --> 16:30.050
Elder, a duel is too much...

16:30.410 --> 16:35.679
With some still doubting whether
this is the Hero we've been longing for,

16:35.680 --> 16:38.940
I believe this is a path
we can no longer avoid.

16:41.130 --> 16:42.419
Very well.

16:42.420 --> 16:45.769
Then I shall serve as the guardian
for the Hakuko,

16:45.770 --> 16:47.850
who is a servant of the Shield Hero.

16:48.250 --> 16:53.220
Jaralis, you must also accept the duel
to uphold your own beliefs.

16:56.330 --> 17:03.290
And to ensure fairness,
I will serve as Jaralis' guardian.

17:03.810 --> 17:06.089
That should be acceptable, no?

17:06.090 --> 17:08.849
Those are some big words, old man.

17:08.850 --> 17:10.769
Are you truly prepared to accept

17:10.770 --> 17:14.179
the consequences as her guardian
should she lose the duel?

17:14.180 --> 17:15.640
Of course.

17:16.740 --> 17:18.960
Then I accept the duel.

17:20.450 --> 17:22.809
This has escalated to be more tense...

17:22.810 --> 17:23.980
Yeah.

17:24.560 --> 17:28.289
We were just trying to use this incident
as our way for heading to Q'ten Lo,

17:28.290 --> 17:30.100
but how did it turn into a duel?

17:30.780 --> 17:33.240
And for my conditions...

17:33.740 --> 17:37.079
First, should we win,
we will expel the Hakuko race

17:37.080 --> 17:40.479
from among the Four Great Races of Siltvelt

17:40.480 --> 17:43.250
and elevate the status of us,
the Raio race.

17:44.250 --> 17:49.140
Next, we will hold the Shield Hero
as the sole property of the country.

17:49.920 --> 17:54.109
And finally, we will strictly punish
that insolent brat over there.

17:54.110 --> 17:56.149
What do you say to that?

17:56.150 --> 17:58.699
Don't be ridiculous!
That's way too convenient for you!

17:58.700 --> 17:59.770
I have no objections.

18:00.290 --> 18:03.480
Master Naofumi,
I simply have to win, that's all!

18:05.040 --> 18:06.310
Got it.

18:06.720 --> 18:10.240
Then if we win, you'll obey
any command we give you.

18:10.550 --> 18:14.950
Of course, Mr. Shield Hero.

18:16.940 --> 18:22.619
Then, if the Hero is victorious,
Siltvelt will follow his orders.

18:22.620 --> 18:23.789
Is that acceptable?

18:23.790 --> 18:25.250
No problem.

18:26.520 --> 18:30.399
Then I authorize the duel between
that Hakuko and Jaralis!

18:30.400 --> 18:31.460
Wait a minute!

18:32.200 --> 18:33.429
Big brother?

18:33.430 --> 18:36.160
Let me fight in that duel too.

18:36.550 --> 18:39.930
I'll fight him instead of Atla!

18:41.060 --> 18:42.230
Oh?

18:42.600 --> 18:44.569
That won't do.

18:44.570 --> 18:46.979
This is an important duel
over Master Naofumi's future.

18:46.980 --> 18:49.289
I can't leave it to you, big brother.

18:49.290 --> 18:49.939
What?

18:49.940 --> 18:53.109
Atla, why not let him?

18:53.110 --> 18:55.659
Fohl is more fired up than usual.

18:55.660 --> 18:57.060
But...

18:57.510 --> 18:59.900
I've got something I want to ask that guy.

19:00.440 --> 19:02.370
This fight will be important not just for me,

19:02.860 --> 19:04.150
but for our father as well.

19:06.040 --> 19:08.190
That's what I feel.

19:09.600 --> 19:12.510
Then I'll take both of you on.

19:14.100 --> 19:19.180
I'll show these filthy Hakuko
what the power of noble blood truly means!

19:20.510 --> 19:24.769
Jaralis, a duel must be fought
with equal numbers.

19:24.770 --> 19:28.860
Ah yes, of course.
We'll prepare one person as well.

19:29.250 --> 19:31.070
Is that alright with you, Hero?

19:34.030 --> 19:36.709
Master Naofumi, don't worry.

19:36.710 --> 19:40.599
Even if my brother falls,
I'll defeat them on my own.

19:40.600 --> 19:42.699
Atla?! I won't be defeated!

19:42.700 --> 19:47.299
To ride the enemy's schemes and surpass them
is the proof of true strength.

19:47.300 --> 19:49.039
I will see this through,
no matter what.

19:49.040 --> 19:50.939
Please, Master Naofumi!

19:50.940 --> 19:52.000
Please!

19:56.200 --> 19:57.470
Alright.

20:09.830 --> 20:11.200
Master Naofumi.

20:12.340 --> 20:14.329
Are you sure about this?

20:14.330 --> 20:18.160
It seems my brother
has his own thoughts.

20:18.710 --> 20:22.809
But this duel is exactly the moment
to show my loyalty to you.

20:22.810 --> 20:26.549
No matter how difficult it may be,
I will press forward.

20:26.550 --> 20:27.500
More than anything,

20:28.060 --> 20:32.960
how could I be your shield
if I can't win a duel like this?

20:34.140 --> 20:35.420
I'm counting on you.

20:36.290 --> 20:39.180
Yes, you can leave it to me.

20:39.710 --> 20:41.140
Both sides, step forward!

20:45.680 --> 20:49.000
What is that Minotaur guy?

20:50.230 --> 20:50.970
Oh, my...

20:51.420 --> 20:53.009
I can't believe it...

20:53.010 --> 20:57.779
Did he summon a hero who survived
the Great War of the past?

20:57.780 --> 21:01.989
Indeed. With the Shield Hero at stake,
this is a battle of utmost importance.

21:01.990 --> 21:05.989
I can't risk bringing along some
nobody that I can't trust.

21:05.990 --> 21:09.850
Everything is for the sake of Siltvelt.

21:10.320 --> 21:13.210
I'll have the Shield Hero
take my daughter in marriage!

21:14.730 --> 21:16.420
His daughter...?

21:23.630 --> 21:27.179
I won't stand by while Master Naofumi
is treated like a mere breeding stallion!

21:27.180 --> 21:29.679
Atla! Fohl!
You better win, no matter what!

21:29.680 --> 21:31.099
Of course!

21:31.100 --> 21:31.690
Yeah.

21:32.320 --> 21:34.690
I'm your opponent, Jaralis.

21:35.240 --> 21:39.400
If I win, you're going to tell me
everything about my father!

